== Third-party attribution ==

Snapmaker tag format support
----------------------------
The Snapmaker MifareClassic tag format spec, the HKDF salt constant
(`SNAPMAKER_KEY_SALT`), and the ten RSA-2048 public keys embedded in
`app/src/main/java/com/spoolpainter/app/hardware/nfc/SnapmakerFormat.kt`
were derived from the openspool_tag_processor module of Snapmaker U1
Klipper:

  https://github.com/Snapmaker/u1-klipper

Snapmaker/u1-klipper is published under GPL-3.0. SpoolPainter inherits
GPL-3.0 as a result of bundling this material.

